ted_at": 1778682307463, "description": "把用户的话进行语义解析，从经典图书中找到最相近的一句金句。通过故事性、情绪性、风格性、作用性、场景性、对象性六个维度匹配，让用户的语言与经典书籍金句产生奇妙共鸣。每次输入都是一次盲盒开启，不知道会匹配到哪本书的经典金句，适合需要金句美文文案时使用。", "description_zh": "把用户的话进行语义解析，从经典图书中找到最相近的一句金句。通过故事性、情绪性、风格性、作用性、场景性、对象性六个维度匹配，让用户的语言与经典书籍金句产生奇妙共鸣。每次输入都是一次盲盒开启，不知道会匹配到哪本书的经典金句，适合需要金句美文文案时使用。", "downloads": 65, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_aad6add3/book-quote-blind-box", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "书籍金句盲盒", "ownerName": "user_aad6add3", "score": 8953.168044077136, "slug": "book-quote-blind-box", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780723852847, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779103750129, "description": "驱动和控制 RDK X5 上的 ST7789 SPI LCD 屏幕。Skill 内置了完整的驱动逻辑，允许 AI 生成无需外部依赖的单文件控制脚本。", "description_zh": "驱动和控制 RDK X5 上的 ST7789 SPI LCD 屏幕。Skill 内置了完整的驱动逻辑，允许 AI 生成无需外部依赖的单文件控制脚本。", "downloads": 65, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_171341e7/rdk-x5-spi-lcd-st7789", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "rdk-x5-spi-lcd-st7789", "ownerName": "user_171341e7", "score": 8879.781420765028, "slug": "rdk-x5-spi-lcd-st7789", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780723852493, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1778335190177, "description": "Solve high-school or college-entrance-exam style derivative problems centered on root existence, root count, and parameter ranges. Use when a problem asks whether a function has roots/intersections, exactly how many roots it has, or which parameters make roots exist. The skill analyzes with derivatives, monotonic intervals, extrema, limits, and value ranges, then rewrites the final proof using concrete point selection, sign changes, continuity, and the intermediate value theorem. In teaching mode, explain where chosen points come from using tangent bounds, exponential/log inequalities, Taylor-style estimates, quadratic fitting, homomorphic transformations, or explicit threshold solving.", "description_zh": "导数取点.skill 是一个面向高考导数压轴题的 AI Skill，专注于零点存在性、零点个数与参数范围证明。它引导 AI 先用导数、单调性、极值与极限分析题目，再把“显然存在”“趋于无穷”这类不够稳妥的表述，改写成具体取点、函数值异号、连续性与零点存在定理的阅卷友好证明。同时，它会解释取点来源，帮助学生理解为什么取这个点，而不是只看到一个突然出现的“神奇点”。\nSolve high-school or college-entrance-exam style derivative problems centered on root existence, root count, and parameter ranges. Use when a problem asks whether a function has roots/intersections, exactly how many roots it has, or which parameters make roots exist. The skill analyzes with derivatives, monotonic intervals, extrema, limits, and value ranges, then rewrites the final proof using concrete point selection, sign changes, continuity, and the intermediate value theorem. In teaching mode, explain where chosen points come from using tangent bounds, exponential/log inequalities, Taylor-style estimates, quadratic fitting, homomorphic transformations, or explicit threshold solving.", "downloads": 65, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c458f2f4/derivative-point-picking", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7920727c-4e7d-496a-9223-d9c6673e9e53.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "导数取点", "ownerName": "user_c458f2f4", "score": 6612.410986775178, "slug": "derivative-point-picking", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780723850198, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1778906703978, "description": "PDF OCR 增强工具 - 使用腾讯云 OCR 将图片型 PDF 转换为可搜索的 OCR 版 PDF。适合处理扫描件、证件、合同等需要高识别精度的场景。", "description_zh": "PDF OCR 增强工具 - 使用腾讯云 OCR 将图片型 PDF 转换为可搜索的 OCR 版 PDF。适合处理扫描件、证件、合同等需要高识别精度的场景。", "downloads": 65, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_7b24470b/pdf-ocr-tencent", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "pdf-ocr-tencent", "ownerName": "user_7b24470b", "score": 8783.783783783785, "slug": "pdf-ocr-tencent", "source": "community", "star